INSERT INTO "messages" ("meta","seq","role","session_id","content","tool_calls","reasoning","inserted_at","id") VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6,$7,$8,$9) [%{}, 3, :assistant, "0d4da033-8107-4dcf-a869-39ad1e84a7b9", "\n\nThe bug is clear: it uses `length(sorted)` instead of `n-1`, and it never interpolates between the two closest ranks. Let me fix it.\n\n", [%{"arguments" => %{"new_string" => "  def percentile(values, p) do\n    sorted = Enum.sort(values)\n    rank = p / 100 * (length(sorted) - 1)\n    lo = trunc(:math.floor(rank))\n    hi = trunc(:math.ceil(rank))\n    a = Enum.at(sorted, lo) * 1.0\n    b = Enum.at(sorted, hi) * 1.0\n    a + (b - a) * (rank - lo)\n  end", "old_string" => "  def percentile(values, p) do\n    sorted = Enum.sort(values)\n    index = trunc(p / 100 * length(sorted))\n    Enum.at(sorted, index) * 1.0\n  end", "path" => "solution.ex"}, "id" => "chatcmpl-tool-8d3dd2f52198ab83", "name" => "edit"}], "Let me analyze. Spec: rank = p/100 * (n-1), interpolate between values at floor(rank) and ceil(rank). Always return float.\n\nCurrent code: `index = trunc(p / 100 * length(sorted))` — uses n instead of (n-1), and just picks one value without interpolation. Let me verify with the example: percentile([1,2,3,4], 50) should be 2.5.\n\nCorrect: n=4, rank = 0.5 * 3 = 1.5, floor=1 (value 2), ceil=2 (value 3), interpolate: 2 + 0.5*(3-2) = 2.5. Good.\n\nLet me write the fix.\n\nI need to compute rank, lo = floor(rank), hi = ceil(rank), interpolate. Edge: when lo==hi just return value. Also need float always.\n\nLet me write:\n\n```elixir\ndef percentile(values, p) do\n  sorted = Enum.sort(values)\n  n = length(sorted)\n  rank = p / 100 * (n - 1)\n  lo = trunc(Float.floor(rank))  # rank is float\n  hi = trunc(Float.ceil(rank))\n  frac = rank - lo\n  a = Enum.at(sorted, lo) * 1.0\n  b = Enum.at(sorted, hi) * 1.0\n  a + (b - a) * frac\nend\n```\n\nSince p/100 is float, rank is float. lo, hi ints. Enum.at returns number; multiply by 1.0 to float. frac float. Good.\n\nLet me edit.\n", ~U[2026-09-11 07:44:04.884722Z], "239441a8-1c61-46b3-bf45-46c86c50abc3"]
